  function syncRows(r){return table(['目标 / 记录','源业务键','接收状态','对账结果'],(r.deliveryRows||[]).map(d=>[esc(d.target),esc(d.key),badge(d.status),esc(d.value||d.result)]));}
  function testDialog(){const r=get();if(!visible(r)||state.role!=='it'||!['process','sso','interface','release'].includes(r.key))return fail(r,'仅信息工程部可运行本流程测试');dialog('锁定用例本地测试',[actionField('fault','测试故障注入','无故障','select','无故障|关键用例失败'),actionField('backup','备份及配置检查','未检查','select','未检查|已检查并生成快照'),actionField('note','测试说明')],v=>runTests(r.id,v));}
  function runTests(id,v){const r=get(id);if(!visible(r)||state.role!=='it')return fail(r,'当前身份无测试权限');if(!['process','interface','sso','release'].includes(r.key)||done(r)||r.stage<0)return fail(r,'仅在已提交、未办结的变更流程运行测试');const f=r.f;const dependency=!f.dependency||f.dependency==='模拟条件齐备';const validMapping=r.key==='sso'?f.mapping.includes('→')&&f.mapping.split('→').every(v=>v.trim()):r.key==='interface'?f.mapping.split('；').every(v=>v.includes('→')):true;const specs=r.key==='sso'?[['有效身份映射',true,dependency&&validMapping],['停用身份允许登录',false,false],['缺失映射允许登录',false,false],['越权身份允许访问',false,false]]:r.key==='interface'?[['映射字段完整',true,validMapping],['相同业务键新增次数',1,1],['失败回传写入有效值',false,false],['外部联调条件就绪',true,dependency]]:r.key==='process'?[['必填字段为空允许提交',false,false],['会签未齐允许通过',false,false],['审批矩阵正常匹配',true,matrix(r).matched],['在途实例引用原版本',true,f.inflight.includes('保留')]]:[['模型计算 920/1000',0.92,920/1000],['权限映射已配置',true,!!f.permissionMapping],['发布包与依赖完整',true,!!f.contents&&!!f.dependencies],['未授权人员可发布',false,false]];
    r.testResults=specs.map(([name,expected,actual],i)=>({name,expected:String(expected),actual:String(v.fault==='关键用例失败'&&i===0?'模拟失败':actual),pass:!(v.fault==='关键用例失败'&&i===0)&&expected===actual}));
    r.checks.testPassed=r.testResults.every(t=>t.pass);r.checks.testVersion=r.formVersion;r.checks.backup=v.backup==='已检查并生成快照';if(r.checks.backup){r.backupVersion=r.effectiveVersion;generateEvidence(r,'测试证据','备份快照：'+r.effectiveVersion+'\n配置与字段：'+JSON.stringify(r.f));}if(r.key==='release'&&!r.checks.backup)r.checks.testPassed=false;generateEvidence(r,'测试证据',JSON.stringify(r.testResults));log(r,'本地测试',r.testResults.filter(t=>t.pass).length+'/'+r.testResults.length+' 通过；'+v.note+'；备份 '+r.checks.backup);toast(r.checks.testPassed?'锁定测试通过，可继续当前节点':'测试或备份检查未通过，请处理后重测');return true;
  }
  function runDialog(){const r=get();if(!visible(r)||state.role!=='it')return fail(r,'仅信息工程部可执行模拟回传');dialog('模拟运行与异常补偿',[actionField('sourceId','来源回传单号',r.id+'-SYNC-'+r.cycle,'text'),actionField('outcome','模拟结果','成功','select','成功|失败|部分成功|超时'),actionField('note','运行说明')],v=>simulate(r.id,v));}
  function simulate(id,v){const r=get(id);if(!visible(r)||state.role!=='it')return fail(r,'当前身份无运行权限');const allowed=r.key==='account'&&r.stage===1||r.key==='masterException'&&r.stage===2&&r.checks.corrected||r.key==='master'&&r.stage===2&&r.checks.executed||r.key==='interface'&&r.stage===5&&r.checks.executed;if(!allowed)return fail(r,'当前节点未具备运行前提：需修正源数据、主数据生效或接口发布');if(!v.sourceId?.trim()||!['成功','失败','部分成功','超时'].includes(v.outcome))return fail(r,'来源单号和模拟结果不合法');
    const businessKey=r.key==='account'?r.id+':'+r.f.personId+':'+r.formVersion:r.f.businessKey||r.f.masterCode+':'+r.f.version;
    const prior=store.runs.find(run=>run.businessKey===businessKey&&run.sourceId===v.sourceId&&run.status==='成功');if(prior){log(r,'幂等命中',prior.id+' 已成功，不重复分发或生成业务记录');toast('相同来源单号及业务键已成功，本次不重复执行');return true;}
    const oldSameSource=store.runs.find(run=>run.sourceId===v.sourceId&&run.businessKey!==businessKey);if(oldSameSource)return fail(r,'来源单号已用于其他业务键，禁止错关联回传');
    const targets=r.key==='account'?[r.f.system+' / '+r.f.account]:r.key==='master'?r.f.targets.split(/[、,，]/).map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean):r.key==='interface'?['ERP / 张薇','ERP / 样例人员02']:['ERP / 组织编码','OA / 员工账号'];
    const existing=r.deliveryRows||[];r.deliveryRows=targets.map((target,i)=>{const old=existing.find(d=>d.target===target);const success=old?.status==='成功'||v.outcome==='成功'||v.outcome==='部分成功'&&i===0;return {target,key:businessKey,status:success?'成功':v.outcome==='超时'?'超时':'失败',value:success?(r.f.correctedValue||r.f.version):'E102 / 待补偿',result:success?'接收成功':'保持原有效值'};});
    const status=r.deliveryRows.every(d=>d.status==='成功')?'成功':r.deliveryRows.some(d=>d.status==='成功')?'部分成功':v.outcome;
    const run={id:'IT-RUN-'+(++sequence),sourceId:v.sourceId,businessKey,requestId:r.id,cycle:r.cycle,trigger:r.status,input:copy(r.f),status,result:r.deliveryRows.filter(d=>d.status==='成功').length+'/'+targets.length+' 项成功；'+v.note,attempt:r.runs.filter(run=>run.sourceId===v.sourceId).length+1,writeback:status==='成功'?'回执就绪，等待独立对账':'失败项挂账，成功项保留',time:config.date};r.runs.push(run);store.runs.push(run);if(status==='成功')r.targetValue=r.f.correctedValue||r.f.version;generateEvidence(r,'处理佐证',JSON.stringify(run));log(r,'模拟回传',run.id+' / '+status+' / '+businessKey);syncService();return true;
  }
  function restoreOnboarding(r){const f=r.f;if(r.related!=='ONB-202608-006'||f.masterCode!=='EMP-2026-026'||f.taskId!=='ONB-T02')return;const o=onboarding(r.related),t=o?.tasks.find(t=>t.id===f.taskId);if(t){t.status='已完成';t.result='HR权威组织编码 '+f.sourceValue+' 与ERP一致；OA/ERP账号完成模拟开通；证据 '+r.runs.at(-1).id;refreshOnboardingState(o);}const identity=store.identities.find(i=>i.id===f.masterCode);if(identity){identity.accounts={OA:'zhangwei / 有效',ERP:'zhangwei / 有效'};}const q=db.qualityRules.find(q=>q.id===f.qualityId);if(q&&q.asset==='HR员工主数据'){q.status='正常';q.score=100;q.batch=r.runs.at(-1).id;q.audit.push({time:config.date,actor:actor().name,action:'分发对账通过',result:r.id+' / '+f.businessKey});}log(r,'关联回写',r.related+' / '+f.taskId+' / '+f.serviceId+' / '+f.qualityId+' 同步恢复；未修改其他任务或MES质量异常');}
  function sourceRetry(id){const s=db.services.find(s=>s.id===id);if(!s?.itRequestId)return false;open(s.itRequestId);toast('已进入同源信息事项，请按修正、复跑、对账节点办理');return true;}
  function useGrant(){expire();const r=get();if(!visible(r))return fail(r,'当前身份无权访问此申请');if(r.key==='report'){const g=store.grants.find(g=>g.id===r.id);if(!g||g.status!=='有效'||g.granteeRole!==state.role||g.start>config.date||g.end<config.date||g.query!=='允许')return fail(r,'当前身份未获得有效查询授权；管理员也不能代替被授权人查询');const rows=store.reportData.filter(row=>row.部门===g.scope);const columns=g.columns.split(/[、,，]/).map(c=>c.trim()).filter(c=>['期间','部门','产值','完成率'].includes(c));log(r,'报表查询','组织 '+g.scope+'；字段 '+columns.join('、')+'；返回 '+rows.length+' 行');openModal('当前身份可见报表',`<div class="aw-context">${esc(actor().name)} · ${esc(g.scope)} · 仅返回批准字段 · ${g.export==='允许'?'可导出':'禁止导出'}</div>`+table(columns,rows.map(row=>columns.map(c=>esc(row[c])))),button('关闭','closeModal()')+button('导出授权结果',"ItWorkspace.exportReport()",'primary',g.export!=='允许'));return;}
    if(r.key==='delegate'){const d=store.delegations.find(d=>d.id===r.id);if(!d||d.status!=='已生效'||d.agentRole!==state.role||d.start>config.date||d.end<config.date)return fail(r,'代理未生效、已失效或当前身份不是指定代理人');dialog('代理试办授权节点',[actionField('scope','拟办理范围',d.nodeScope,'select',d.nodeScope+'|合同审批（排除事项）'),actionField('note','办理意见')],v=>{if(v.scope!==d.nodeScope){d.uses.push({time:config.date,actor:actor().name,node:v.scope,result:'越界拦截'});return fail(r,'该节点不在代理批准范围内');}d.uses.push({time:config.date,actor:actor().name,node:v.scope,result:v.note});log(r,'代理办理',d.grantor+' → '+d.agent+'；'+v.note);return true;});return;}
    const g=store.grants.find(g=>g.id===r.id);if(!g||g.status!=='有效'||g.granteeRole!==state.role||g.start>config.date||g.end<config.date)return fail(r,'当前身份无该账号的有效使用权限');log(r,'使用账号权限',g.system+' / '+g.roles+' / '+g.scope);openModal('当前授权生效结果',pairs([['目标系统',g.system],['目标账号',g.account],['角色/功能',g.roles],['组织范围',g.scope],['引用版本','申请 V'+g.sourceVersion]]));
  }
  function exportReport(){const r=get(),g=store.grants.find(g=>g.id===r?.id);if(!visible(r)||!g||g.status!=='有效'||g.granteeRole!==state.role||g.export!=='允许'||g.query!=='允许'||g.end<config.date||g.start>config.date)return fail(r,'无有效报表导出权限');const columns=g.columns.split(/[、,，]/).map(c=>c.trim()).filter(c=>['期间','部门','产值','完成率'].includes(c));const rows=store.reportData.filter(row=>row.部门===g.scope);download(new Blob(['\ufeff'+[columns.join(','),...rows.map(row=>columns.map(c=>row[c]).join(','))].join('\r\n')],{type:'text/csv'}),'已授权指标明细.csv');log(r,'报表导出',g.scope+' / '+columns.join('、')+' / '+rows.length+'行');}
  function settings(){openModal('演示配置与待确认规则',pairs([['演示日期',config.date],['审批矩阵',config.matrixVersion+' / '+config.effective+' 至 '+config.expiry],['提醒窗口',config.warningDays+'天（待确认）'],['身份/权限边界','同公司，按部门/申请人/职责授权；审批与执行身份分离'],['外部边界','不含真实生产账号、密钥、SSO或系统发布'],['客户待确认','组织权威源、审批阈值、代理时限、敏感字段、发布窗口、SLA及重试策略']])+`<div class="iw-tools">${button('演示日期推进1天',"ItWorkspace.clock(1)",'primary',state.role!=='it'&&state.role!=='manager')}${button('演示日期推进7天',"ItWorkspace.clock(7)",'secondary',state.role!=='it'&&state.role!=='manager')}</div>`);}
  function clock(days){if(!['it','manager'].includes(state.role)||![1,7].includes(days))return fail(null,'仅信息工程部或管理层可推进演示日期');const date=new Date(config.date+'T00:00:00Z');date.setUTCDate(date.getUTCDate()+days);config.date=date.toISOString().slice(0,10);expire();log(null,'推进演示日期',config.date);closeModal();render();}
  function governance(type){ui.governance=type;nav('it-governance');}
  function governanceView(){let body='';if(ui.governance==='identity')body=panel('统一组织身份及账号映射',table(['统一标识 / 员工','公司 / 部门 / 岗位','任职 / 权威源','账号映射'],store.identities.map(i=>[i.id+' / '+esc(i.name),esc(i.company+' / '+i.department+' / '+i.job),i.employment+' / '+i.source,esc(JSON.stringify(i.accounts))])),button('模拟张薇岗位异动，生成权限任务',"ItWorkspace.governanceAction('movement')",'primary',state.role!=='hr'))+panel('五类主数据标准目录',table(['主数据类型 / 编码','名称','权威源 / 责任部门','有效版本'],store.masterCatalog.map(m=>[m.type+' / '+m.code,esc(m.name),m.source+' / '+m.owner,m.version])),button('进入主数据维护流程',"ItWorkspace.list('master')"));else if(ui.governance==='matrix')body=panel('动态审批矩阵（演示配置，待客户确认）',table(['匹配维度','演示值','异常分支'],[['公司',config.company,'不匹配：挂账、不提交'],['部门 / 岗位','业务部门 / 授权岗位','无责任人：待规则确认'],['角色 / 事项类型','申请人 + 10条流程配置','审批与执行分离'],['风险 / 金额','高风险独立管理层审批；金额不参与本节演示路由','阈值待客户确认'],['版本 / 有效期',config.matrixVersion+' / '+config.effective+'—'+config.expiry,'过期不匹配']]),button('模拟正常 / 无匹配规则',"ItWorkspace.governanceAction('matrix')"))+panel('实施基线及变更分类',table(['基线','引用版本','范围说明'],store.baselines.map(row=>row.map(esc))),button('登记缺陷 / 范围变更评估',"ItWorkspace.governanceAction('scope')"))+panel('变更评估记录',table(['日期','类别','影响 / 处理结论'],store.logs.filter(l=>l.action==='变更分类评估').map(l=>[l.time,'演示评估',esc(l.result)])));else body=panel('PC / 移动责任待办同源',`<div class="iw-mobile-todos">${db.todos.filter(t=>t.namespace==='it'&&(state.role==='manager'||t.role===state.role)).map(t=>`<article><small>${esc(t.id)} · ${esc(t.due)}</small><b>${esc(t.title)}</b>${button('进入办理',`ItWorkspace.open('${t.objectId}')`,'link')}</article>`).join('')||'<p>当前身份无信息事项待办</p>'}</div>`)+panel('外部待办模拟回传',table(['业务键','事项 / 对象','来源状态','本地同步'],store.externalTodos.filter(t=>t.role===state.role||state.role==='manager').map(t=>[esc(t.businessKey),esc(t.title)+' / '+esc(t.objectId),esc(t.status),esc(t.sync)])),button('模拟新增 / 已办 / 撤回 / 失效',"ItWorkspace.governanceAction('externalTodo')"))+panel('内部待办处理历史',table(['待办','原办理身份','结果'],store.todoHistory.filter(t=>t.role===state.role||state.role==='manager').map(t=>[esc(t.id),esc(roles[t.role]?.label),esc(t.status)])));
    return shell(banner()+button('返回工作台',"go('itHome')")+body,'信息工程公共治理','公共能力引用，不新增SOW流程编号');}
  function governanceAction(type){if(type==='movement'){if(state.role!=='hr')return fail(null,'仅人力资源身份可模拟人员异动来源');const existing=records().find(r=>r.f.sourceEvent==='HR-MOVE-202608-026');if(existing){open(existing.id);return;}create('account');ui.edit.record.f.sourceEvent='HR-MOVE-202608-026';ui.edit.record.f.operation='权限变更';ui.edit.record.f.currentRoles='设备报工';ui.edit.record.f.requestedRoles='生产班组报工与查看';ui.edit.record.f.dataScope='生产管理部';ui.edit.record.f.system='MES';ui.edit.record.related='ONB-202608-006';ui.edit.record.title='张薇岗位异动账号权限同步';render();return;}
    if(type==='matrix'){dialog('审批矩阵匹配演示',[actionField('company','公司抬头',config.company,'select',config.company+'|未配置公司'),actionField('note','匹配说明')],v=>{const matched=v.company===config.company&&config.date<=config.expiry;log(null,'审批矩阵匹配',matched?'命中业务/数据/管理层岗位':'无匹配，提交挂账，不自动放行');toast(matched?'已匹配演示岗位':'无匹配人，必须完善矩阵后提交');return true;});return;}
    if(type==='scope'){if(!['it','manager'].includes(state.role))return fail(null,'仅信息工程部及管理层登记变更评估');dialog('实施基线变更评估',[actionField('category','变更类别','缺陷修复','select','缺陷修复|新增范围'),actionField('impact','范围 / 工期 / 接口影响'),actionField('note','评估处理意见')],v=>{log(null,'变更分类评估',v.category+' / '+v.impact+' / '+v.note+(v.category==='新增范围'?'；仅登记待审批，不纳入已承诺范围':''));return true;});return;}
    if(type==='externalTodo'){if(!['it','manager'].includes(state.role))return fail(null,'仅信息工程部和管理层模拟外部回传');dialog('外部待办回传（模拟）',[actionField('businessKey','源系统业务键','ERP:EMP-2026-026:ORG','text'),actionField('status','来源状态','新增','select','新增|已办|撤回|失效'),actionField('outcome','回传结果','成功','select','成功|失败'),actionField('note','回传说明')],v=>receiveTodo(v));}
  }
  function receiveTodo(v){if(!['it','manager'].includes(state.role))return fail(null,'当前身份无外部回传权限');let t=store.externalTodos.find(t=>t.businessKey===v.businessKey);if(t&&t.status===v.status&&t.sync==='成功'&&v.outcome==='成功'){log(null,'外部待办幂等命中',v.businessKey);return true;}if(!t){t={id:'EXT-'+(++sequence),businessKey:v.businessKey,title:'ERP组织编码同步处理',objectId:'MDE-202608-006',role:'it'};store.externalTodos.push(t);}t.status=v.status;t.sync=v.outcome;if(v.outcome==='成功'){db.todos=db.todos.filter(row=>row.externalBusinessKey!==v.businessKey);if(v.status==='新增')db.todos.push({id:t.id,externalBusinessKey:v.businessKey,objectId:t.objectId,title:t.title,role:'it',due:config.date,status:'待处理'});}log(null,'外部待办同步',v.businessKey+' / '+v.status+' / '+v.outcome);return true;}
